           "text": "@Esmé Cowles"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ":  I'm assuming that the supported  external content types is implementation dependent.  Is that right?  Also looking at the documentation for the current version of fedora, it is not clear what the supported access-types.  Any thoughts?  Also, I am assuming that this issue is directly related to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2586"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2586",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ".  Please correct me if I'm wrong.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
