      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Yes, definitely related to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2586\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2586\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Unsupported external-body access-types must result in 415 Unsupported Media Type\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2586\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.  I think we currently only support access-type=\"url\".  We've talked about adding support for local-file, but that should be a separate ticket.</p>",
